WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.816 --> 00:00:03.517
(light music)

00:00:03.517 --> 00:00:04.397
- [Gary] I'm scared.

00:00:04.397 --> 00:00:05.726
I'm scared because

00:00:05.726 --> 00:00:07.736
I know that there 
are so many of you

00:00:07.736 --> 00:00:09.926
that graduate this month

00:00:09.926 --> 00:00:12.595
and have no 
(record scratching) idea what

00:00:12.595 --> 00:00:13.755
you want to do.

00:00:13.755 --> 00:00:15.015
I'm scared that 
you don't realize

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:16.225
that you're entering

00:00:16.225 --> 00:00:19.016
the greatest five year 
window of your life.

00:00:19.016 --> 00:00:20.834
This next five year 
window is when

00:00:20.834 --> 00:00:22.824
you don't go practical and safe.

00:00:22.824 --> 00:00:26.763
This is not the time to get 
the job mom wanted you to.

00:00:26.763 --> 00:00:29.783
This is the time to 
be massively risk oriented

00:00:29.783 --> 00:00:30.683
and not all of you,

00:00:30.683 --> 00:00:32.144
I'm sure one of you 
will leave a comment saying,

00:00:32.144 --> 00:00:32.911
"I've got a loan."

00:00:32.911 --> 00:00:34.122
I get it, respect.

00:00:34.122 --> 00:00:35.953
But that loan is gonna 
be there whether you

00:00:35.953 --> 00:00:38.292
go and try to build something 
for yourself or not.

00:00:38.292 --> 00:00:39.893
One way or the other, 
when you're in your

00:00:39.893 --> 00:00:42.782
early 20s this is 
when you can grind

00:00:42.782 --> 00:00:44.502
at your highest levels

00:00:44.502 --> 00:00:47.123
'cause there isn't 
all the (record scratch) baggage

00:00:47.123 --> 00:00:49.085
that comes across with life.

00:00:50.432 --> 00:00:51.867
(bell bings)

